# ...but reference material is not a run artifact. Laura's real CageFlow output
# is checked in deliberately: it is the schema we have to produce, and the only
# example of it we have.
!demos/cnio/reference/
!demos/cnio/reference/*.jsonl

# ...same reasoning for the Track A/B parity comparison: these are the evidence that the
# AsyncFlow rewrite reproduces her science, not disposable run output. See
# demos/cnio/1_sync/PARITY_REPORT.md.
!demos/cnio/1_sync/original/results/
!demos/cnio/1_sync/original/results/*.jsonl
!demos/cnio/1_sync/flowgentic/results/
!demos/cnio/1_sync/flowgentic/results/*.jsonl


